:INFO
Art. 1
This Ordinance regulates:
a. the assessment criteria for the imposition of sanctions in accordance with Article 49a paragraph 1 Cartel Act;
b. the conditions and the procedure for obtaining complete or partial immunity from sanctions in accordance with Article 49a paragraph 2 Cartel Act;
c. the conditions and the procedure for notifications under Article 49a paragraph 3 letter a Cartel Act.

